            {
              "id": "insecure-random",
              "name": "Insecure randomness for a security value",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Insecure randomness for a security value"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Insecure randomness for a security value"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Use a CSPRNG for tokens/keys/salts/nonces/OTPs: `secrets` (Python), `crypto.randomBytes` (Node), `crypto/rand` (Go). `Math.random`/`random`/`rand`/`mt_rand` are predictable.",
                "markdown": "Use a CSPRNG for tokens/keys/salts/nonces/OTPs: `secrets` (Python), `crypto.randomBytes` (Node), `crypto/rand` (Go). `Math.random`/`random`/`rand`/`mt_rand` are predictable."
              },
